  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast bias when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) — model tends to overestimate prices.",
    "Adjust downward for forecasts that overshoot recent highs — especially after spikes in price or sentiment.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction: if forecast is > 1.5x recent 5-day average, reduce by 10-20%.",
    "For sentiment = 0.5, slightly dampen forecast volatility — model overreacts to minor sentiment shifts.",
    "Lag correction: if forecast is > 3 days ahead of true outcome, reduce by 5-10% to account for delayed market reaction.",
    "Avoid over-optimistic forecasts when history shows strong downward momentum — especially if last 5 days are below 65.00."
  ]
